 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Straw Doll Technique — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><p>Beginning at 1st level, due to your experience with your technique, you will start with 1 Hammer, 24 nails, and 1 straw doll. As an action for 1 Cursed Energy, you strike 2 nails by hitting them with your hammer. Make two melee or ranged cursed energy attack rolls with a range of 20/60 feet. On a hit, each nail deals 1d6 + your CE modifier piercing damage. You can also spend 2 additional Cursed Energy to make 2 additional attacks in this way.<br />\n At 6th level, you have become rather cheap with your nails, making sure to always recover as many as possible from the battlefield. As a bonus action while touching a creature that has taken damage from Nail Projectile, you can make a DC 10 Dexterity check. On a success, you regain the nail.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
